      "type": "text",
      "x": 45,
      "y": 1025,
      "width": 1630,
      "height": 65,
      "fontSize": 22,
      "text": "Deciding test: stale terms, read-only access, revoked permission, denial, and a response lost after commit.\nScore company state and both parties' cost. A local fixture is not a live vendor integration.",
